sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Marketing Team User
    participant FE as ReportStatus<br/>«view»
    participant RC as ReportController<br/>«controller»
    participant RS as ReportService<br/>«service»
    participant RR as ReportRepository<br/>«repository»

    U->>FE: open /reports/{reportId}
    FE->>RC: GET /api/reports/{reportId}/status
    RC-->>FE: ReportStatusResponse(status, failureReason?)

    opt status non-terminal (QUEUED or PROCESSING)
        FE-->>U: spinner "analysis in progress" — page auto-refreshes
        loop poll every 2s until status is terminal
            FE->>RC: GET /api/reports/{reportId}/status
            RC-->>FE: ReportStatusResponse
        end
    end

    alt status = COMPLETED
        FE->>RC: GET /api/reports/{reportId}
        RC->>RS: getReportOverview(reportId)
        RS->>RR: loadOverview(reportId, companyId)
        RR-->>RS: ReportOverviewProjection
        RS-->>RC: ReportOverviewResponse<br/>(brandName, dataSource, dates,<br/>score, analyzedPosts, filteredOutCount,<br/>emotionDistribution, aspects[])
        RC-->>FE: 200 OK
        FE-->>U: render header + overview + emotion distribution + aspect breakdown

        opt user expands "filtered-out posts" (lazy)
            FE->>RC: GET /api/reports/{reportId}/posts?relevance=IRRELEVANT
            RC-->>FE: page of irrelevant posts
            FE-->>U: list of filtered-out posts (see view-posts.mmd)
        end
    else status = FAILED
        FE-->>U: error banner with failureReason
    end
